xpires, especially product 1.\n- **Candidate 4** orders about 1.25× forecast for product 0 but about 0.95× for product 1, so it runs short on product 1.\n- **Candidate 0** orders about 1.05–1.1× forecast.\n\n**Rough ranking.**\n- Candidates 6 and 7 are most likely in the top half: cheapest fixed costs and enough stock.\n- Candidate 0 is my pick for the fourth place, but that is uncertain. Candidates 3 and 5 are close behind; candidate 2 trails because of its lost sales.\n- Candidates 1 and 4 are most likely in the bottom half."}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4387, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creation": {"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens": 0, "ephemeral_1h_input_tokens": 4387}, "output_tokens": 8, "service_tier": "standard", "inference_geo": "global", "speed": "standard"}, "input_transformations": [], "diagnostics": null, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "timestamp": "2026-10-28T22:13:23.134Z", "request_id": "req_011CgVQLVZPLHkEMEFDYQVnU"}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_stop", "index": 1}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "stream_event", "event": {"type": "content_block_start", "index": 2, "content_block": {"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015hgqc2Gr1HC8LxMf1PD27k", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}}, "parent_tool_use_id": null}, {"type": "assistant", "message": {"model": "claude-opus-5-5", "id": "msg_011CgVQLVmnZyDD63P2EkpfT", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "tool_use", "id": "toolu_015hgqc2Gr1HC8LxMf1PD27k", "name": "StructuredOutput", "input": {"p": [0.55, 0.1, 0.4, 0.45, 0.25, 0.45, 0.85, 0.75]}, "caller": {"type": "direct"}}], "container": null, "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "stop_details": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 2, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 4387, "cache_read_input_tokens": 2313, "cache_creatio